# Generated simulation/build artifacts (not evidence; EVIDENCE.md is tracked)
# coverage.dat files are generated by every sim run and were untracked on
# 2026-09-18 (review finding L19): a tracked copy let `make coverage` pass on
# a fresh clone with no simulation having run. The TB-written reports
# (func_coverage*.txt, cycles.txt) stay tracked because docs cite them.
tb/*/coverage.dat
tb/*/coverage_pipe_rom1.dat
tb/*/sim_build/
tb/*/sim_build_pipe_rom1/
tb/*/results.xml
tb/*/results_pipe_rom1.xml
tb/*/dump.vcd
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# sby working directories (formal/<module>/ created per run; .sby files are tracked)
formal/*/
obj_dir/
.claude/settings.local.json
.history_sta
tb/vhdl_mac/trace_*.txt
tb/vhdl_mac/sim_build*/
tb/vhdl_mac/results*.xml
tb/uvm/xsim.dir/
tb/uvm/*.log
tb/uvm/*.jou
tb/uvm/*.pb
tb/uvm/*.wdb
tb/*/sim_build_rebuild*/
# gate-generated per-seed UVM vector files (only seed 17 is tracked)
tb/uvm/vectors/*
